  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">What Works to Prevent Violence: Impact at Scale - Research and Evaluation Component</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The research and evaluation component of the What Works programme will deliver impact evaluations and operational research to identify what works in preventing violence against women and girls. These evaluations will focus on measuring impact and learning lessons from the interventions supported by the implementation component of the programme.</narrative>
  </description>
